  "details": "If user doesn't logged in, opening protected page leads to login page. And after login, it goes to user's home page not requested page.\n\nSteps:\n\n1. Open https://vrchat.com/home/\n2. Ensure logout\n3. Open protected URL. For example https://vrchat.com/home/world/wrld_b51f016d-1073-4c75-930d-9f44222c7fc3\n4. Then redirect to https://vrchat.com/home/login for login\n5. Enter username and password and login\n6. Then redirect to https://vrchat.com/home It should redirect to the URL of step 3",
